:false,"components":[{"component_id":"interactive_dialogue","layout":"","data":"{\"list\":[{\"root_id\":\"8gfxrw8wla9T1710863939170\",\"child_ids\":{\"4cf2vhylew3T1710863944349\":[\"y62cj14776T1783580869428\"],\"8gfxrw8wla9T1710863939170\":[\"nqb471m7nmnT1710863941173\",\"z2tn3pzsbujT1710863943430\",\"4cf2vhylew3T1710863944349\",\"b9p7smm57ltT1783580858965\"],\"b9p7smm57ltT1783580858965\":[\"iqaz5yqc7vT1783581054068\"],\"bohdxqvejz5T1783581120755\":[],\"hp50q26bclqT1783581112196\":[\"bohdxqvejz5T1783581120755\"],\"iqaz5yqc7vT1783581054068\":[\"hp50q26bclqT1783581112196\"],\"nqb471m7nmnT1710863941173\":[\"iqaz5yqc7vT1783581054068\"],\"y62cj14776T1783580869428\":[\"iqaz5yqc7vT1783581054068\"],\"z2tn3pzsbujT1710863943430\":[\"iqaz5yqc7vT1783581054068\"]},\"contents\":{\"4cf2vhylew3T1710863944349\":{\"option\":\"【你是…？】\",\"dialogue\":\"\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e我是这个茶摊的主人，小本生意，赚不来多少钱。不过啊，故事倒是不少。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e嘿嘿…在这开一个茶摊，最享受的莫过于看行人来来往往，再随便听听故事。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"8gfxrw8wla9T1710863939170\":{\"option\":\"【开场白】\",\"dialogue\":\"\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e客人您好，请来这边坐！\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"b9p7smm57ltT1783580858965\":{\"option\":\"【再见。】\",\"dialogue\":\"\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e欸，客人慢走！\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e浮萍一生，莫抱憾告老…\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"bohdxqvejz5T1783581120755\":{\"option\":\"\",\"dialogue\":\"\u003chr\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"hp50q26bclqT1783581112196\":{\"option\":\"【开场白】\",\"dialogue\":\"\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e哈哈…这年轻人的花样可越来越多了。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e诗歌大会…嗯，遥想我年轻的时候，也有好多能写的故事…\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e哎…山月常在，红颜易消啊…\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"iqaz5yqc7vT1783581054068\":{\"option\":\"\",\"dialogue\":\"\u003chr\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"text-align: center\\\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e【活动「游水酝诗籍」期间】\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"nqb471m7nmnT1710863941173\":{\"option\":\"【请给我来些茶水。】——打开商店界面\",\"dialogue\":\"\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e虽然我这儿卖的不是什么名茶，但味道一点都不差，来尝尝吧！\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\",\"icon\":\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2026/07/09/288180982/11ee64c710e3b091256c0d349ac55461_4915972873935216781.png\"},\"y62cj14776T1783580869428\":{\"option\":\"【故事…？】\",\"dialogue\":\"\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e客人您看，我也是一身老骨头了。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e这辈子没经历过什么大风大浪，过得也还算安稳踏实…\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e可人老了，总觉得少了点什么。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e于是，我就带着些盘缠离开了轻策山…\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e从轻策庄出来啊，我就决定在这里开一个摊子，啥也不干，就听人讲故事，也给人讲故事…过得也挺好的。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"z2tn3pzsbujT1710863943430\":{\"option\":\"【这里是…？】\",\"dialogue\":\"\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e这里是石门，过了这儿，再往南走就是璃月了！\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e客人您来点茶水吗？\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\"}}}],\"root_id\":\"\",\"child_ids\":null,\"contents\":null}\n","style":""}],"id":"3885","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":true,"switch":false,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"秘闻馆情报","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"collapse_panel","layout":"","data":"{\"rich_text\":\"\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\",\"switch\":false,\"is_show_switch\":true,\"without_border\":false}\n","style":""}],"id":"8697","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":true,"switch":false,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is